  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes: subscribing to both IReader.RecordParsed and a reader's typed RecordParsed no longer throws; the dynamic mappers' ComplexProperty accepts a nested object member of any type rather than only string; an injector-based FixedLengthWriter no longer writes a blank line for WriteSchema; a DelimitedReader whose schema selector matches nothing skips the record once the error is handled, as FixedLengthReader does, instead of returning it parsed with an invented schema; FixedLengthReader's IReader.GetSchemaAsync honours its cancellation token. No API changes. Source- and binary-compatible with 7.4.0.",
